<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 7.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 7.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 April 7		April 4</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.131		  5.652</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  11.060		 12.173</p>
<p>Cash balance		  16.192		 17.825</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,298.359	     5,297.566</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $3 million were issued and $87 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
